  [PASS] C4  on the RAW nu_RAR arm of sec.4.4's open fork the Hessian DOES degenerate, for every kappa <= 0.0324.  NEGATIVE for that arm -- and it is the arm the programme's frozen recipe names.   (min Delta' = -0.0323806; the degeneracy surface Delta' = -kappa is crossed twice for any kappa < 0.0324)

